# Grade of the law of distribution of the vector of the digital twin of the enterprise

**Authors:** Sergei Masaev, Ivan Oreshnikov, Nikita Ivanitskiy, Valentina Vingert

## Summary
Digital transformation acts as a main factor in the development and competitiveness of Japanese companies. In this context, the digital copy management algorithm based on the P2M (Project to Method) method plays a significant role in increasing efficiency and reducing costs through the implementation of digital technologies. This research aims to develop and implement an algorithm for managing a digital copy of a project using the P2M method using the Kolmogorov test to evaluate the effectiveness of various processes and determine the best ways to improve productivity.


